<title>USA: US Jan existing home sales data put back to Friday.</title>
<headline>US Jan existing home sales data put back to Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Association of Realtors said Monday it would release data on existing home sales for January at 1000 EST (1500 GMT) Friday Feb 28 instead of at the same time on Thursday Feb 27 as previously scheduled.</p>
</text>
